  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR humanitarian action in relation to Pakistan floods 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation contributes to meeting the objectives of the UNHCR in Pakistan in relation to the 2022 floods.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation of 10 million DKK to the UNHCR contributes to meeting the objectives of the UNHCR in Pakistan where they contribute to the 2022 Floods Response Plan. The Response Plan points to 6.4 million people in need and calls for 160.3 million USD to reach 5.2 million people with humanitarian assistance. UNHCR plans to assist some 50,000 households in the worst affected areas with over a million relief items.

Due to its nature as a response to a humanitarian appeal operational results are general and highly aggregated and the MFA contribution is thus reflected in the overall results reporting by the partner.  Please refer to the hyperlink below.

https://www.unhcr.org/evaluation-service.html</narrative>
  </description>
